&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.3pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-22.7pt;"&gt;名古屋市中区栄三丁目15番33号&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.3pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-22.7pt;"&gt;三井住友信託銀行株式会社　証券代行部&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:24.5pt;min-height:24.5pt;"&gt;
